  "description": "YIGKOP crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 O12 Tm4. From the CIF bond table, Tm1 (Tm) has 5 O neighbors; Tm1B (Tm) has 5 O neighbors; Tm1A (Tm) has 5 O neighbors; Tm1C (Tm) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.514-3.514 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.74-105.12°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132O12Tm4.",
